{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12699","headline":"樊上漫作 · 元结","name":"樊上漫作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漫家郎亭下，复在樊水边。\n去郭五六里，扁舟到门前。\n山竹绕茅舍，庭中有寒泉。\n西边双石峰，引望堪忘年。\n四邻皆渔父，近渚多闲田。\n且欲学耕钓，於斯求老焉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12699.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12699","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}